@sheet Data
-Product-Amount-
| A | 5 |
| B | 7 |
-Service-Hours-Rate-
| Audit | 2 | 40 |
| Support | 3 | 30 |

@sheet Summary
-Metric-Value-
| Product total | =Data!B2+Data!B3 |
| Service rate total | =Data!C5+Data!C6 |

@sheet Review
-Metric-Value-
| Carry | =Summary!B2+Summary!B3 |
| Hours | =Data!B5+Data!B6 |
